# Product

One Go binary, one Postgres, HTMX UI. Do not grow the surface.

- No new module dependency unless the user names the package.
- No SETAM scrape, bidding, deposits, auth, accounts, or second frontend.
- No React/SPA, WASM, extra process, queue, or search engine.
- `RIA_API_KEY`, `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`, `DATABASE_URL` stay in env. Never log or commit them.
- Freemium RIA: cache by spec-hash, not per lot. No paid AI / period series.
- UI copy stays Ukrainian. List filters stay on `GET /` and `GET /lots/{id}`.

Houses still classify as apartments until the user asks to split them.
